d2 (0.8.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release
  * Follow the upstream module path from oss.terrastruct.com/d2 to
    github.com/d2lang/d2, which moved at v0.8.0. The version ldflag named the
    old path, and Go silently ignores an -X for a symbol that does not exist,
    so the binary would have reported the tree's stale literal instead of the
    packaged version.
  * Point UPSTREAM at github.com/d2lang/d2 rather than relying on the redirect
  * Add debian/watch
  * Standards-Version 4.7.2.0

 -- pkg.haus archive <archive@pkg.haus>  Fri, 28 Aug 2026 17:58:34 +0200

